    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><dateline><date when="1948-09-30">September 30, 1948</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__638" type="person"
                        >Horace</rs>:</salute></opener>
                <p>I enclose two letters from a group of people in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__279"
                        type="place">Marburg</rs><note type="ea">Liegen nicht vor.</note> who would
                    like to imitate our RELIGION AND HEALTH Seminar.<!--<note type="ea">Das Seminar
                            <q>Religion and Health</q> fand im Jahr 1946 statt.</note>-->
                    Since most of them are able to read English I suggest that we send them a copy
                    of all our mimeographed contributions (I suppose that there are still some
                    available) and that we ask them to send us in return their papers.</p>
                <p>I hope to meeting you soon, latest in the Philosophy Club. I had an extremely
                    interesting summer and met <rs>Herbert</rs> in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__1233"
                        type="place">Mainz</rs> and <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__5134" type="person"
                        >Edman</rs> in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__271" type="place"
                    >London</rs>.</p>
                <closer><salute>Cordially yours,</salute><signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928"
                            type="person">Prof. Tillich</rs></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
